      "shortDescription": "AlphaDynamic Pumps designs and manufactures industrial pumps in Greece. Its official range includes air-operated diaphragm, peristaltic, magnetic-drive, horizontal and vertical centrifugal, flexible-impeller, progressive-cavity and helicoidal pumps, plus flowmeters and pulsation dampeners.",
      "fullDescription": [
        "AlphaDynamic Pumps S.A. is a Greek pump manufacturer founded in 2004. Official company information states that it designs, develops and manufactures pumps and identifies its headquarters and factory in the Inofita industrial area. The company began exporting in 2008 and supplies equipment for industrial and marine duties.",
        "The published portfolio spans Ruby air-operated double-diaphragm pumps, RubyShine FDA and RubyPharma hygienic diaphragm designs, NAYARA peristaltic hose pumps, ADM magnetic-drive centrifugal pumps, ADH horizontal and ADV vertical centrifugal pumps, AD flexible-impeller pumps, ATLAS progressive-cavity pumps and ADE helicoidal pumps. Complementary products include ADPD pulsation dampeners, ADF oval-gear flowmeters and IMPA marine products. Official product and download pages provide series-level documentation for fluid-transfer applications in industrial, marine, food, pharmaceutical and chemical processes."
